    "https://vipbrandingexperience.com/branding-powerday-form/": "Branding Powerday Form – VIP Branding Experience\nPackages\nAbout\nFounder\nClients\nContact\nMenu\nMenu\nAre You Ready?\nWe Are So Excited To Share Our Branding Services With You\nFirst, please take moment and tell us who you are?\n© Copyright - VIP Branding Experience 2026 - \nTerms & Conditions\n | \nPrivacy Policy\nScroll to top\nScroll to top\nScroll to top",
    "https://vipbrandingexperience.com/portfolio-item/ann-law-2/": "Ann Law – VIP Branding Experience\nPackages\nAbout\nFounder\nClients\nContact\nMenu\nMenu\nScroll to next section\nScroll to next section\nAmerica's Wellness Coach\nAnn Law is an author and a serial entrepreneur with over 25 years of experience in health care management as a Family Nurse Practicioner. Ann has a FNP/RPA. She established the Nurse Practitioner Organization in NY featured in a book, \"A Few Strong Women\". Ann has dedicated her life to teaching wellness to the world. Ann has travel around over 6 different countries and loves to do power walking. Ann was awarded as Dutchess County Legislator and Congressional Campaign Manager, Ann's greatest passion is to make America healthy again.\nCredibility Card\nShowcases the client’s trajectory, leveraging their personal experiences and passions to create a connection with their potential customers.\nProfile Picture\nAnimated Gif\nVideo Marketing Services\nVideo allows you to share the maximum amount of information quickly and has the highest engagement. If you don’t have videos on your website, social media and email marketing then you are behind your competition.\n360 Welcome\nYour 360 Site is the most powerful marketing and networking tool you have! Now, with a welcome video, your prospects and leads can get a quick tour of your 360 site and be able to fully navigate your social media and contact page. This will increase retention and 10x the \"WOW Factor\" of your 360 site.\nPersonal Intro\nIntroduction Videos are great for building relatedness between the business owners or representatives and potential\ncustomer/clients. Gives people a closer inside look which really helps separate you from the competition.\nSocial Media Covers and Content\nHaving consistent branding across all social media platforms makes it easier for customers to engage with your brand and navigate your online presence, which can lead to more effective marketing campaigns and brand awareness.\nX\nWith over 500 million users, it is one of the world’s largest social networks. Users can\nshare and post text messages, images, and videos known historically as “tweets”.\nLinkedin Cover\nLinkedIn is the largest online professional network in the world. You can use LinkedIn\nto find the perfect job or internship, connect and strengthen professional relationships,\nand learn the skills you need to succeed in your career.\nYoutube Cover\nYouTube channel brings brand exposure to a Worldwide Audience, can help generate\nleads, become a trusted authority, acquire customers, diversifies your marketing efforts.\nPersonal Facebook Cover\nKeep up with friends and family on a daily basis. This is the place to share personal\nphotos and status updates with people who are close to you.\nInstagram Stories\nStories allow you to share everyday moments and grow closer to the people and interests you care about through photos and videos that disappear after 24 hours.\nYou can choose to share your Stories with all your followers or your Close Friends list, and also add them to your profile as story highlights.\nADDITIONAL BRANDING ASSETS\nHaving the same brand identity through every client communication and platform creates a cohesive and unified image for your brand, which can help strengthen your brand identity and messaging.\nEmail Signature\nThis a live example of what the email signature looks like send sending a client and email.\nPhone Lock Screen QR Code\n2 different options to add your QR code to your lock screen and\nmake it easy for people to scan\nZoom Backgrounds\n2 different options for you to use in zoom as a background (the 3 of\nthem include different pieces of info)\nMy360 Sites\nLaunch, Build, Grow, and Monetize your Online Presence like never before.\nBy amplifying your exposure with a living, breathing, interactive digital business card designed by entrepreneurs for entrepreneurs\nConnect With Ann\nPRINT PACKAGES\nHave your branding everywhere you go. With these printed elements you will increase credibility, create a WOW effect on your audience, and generate more leads. These are perfect for speaking, networking events and to record client testimonials.\nBiz Card\nFor printing, double sided.\nRetractable Banner\nFor printing a banner with all of your info.\nRetractable banners pull out of and retract into an aluminum stand or base for maximum portability.\nThis feature makes these banners the ultimate signage solution for trade shows, events and conferences with all of your info.\nSocial Media Signs\nFor printing, double sided.\nMore of our amazing Branding Clients\nTim Eid\nJohn Martindale\nDannella Burnett\nKhalil Stultz\nNikki Green\nChuck Barnard\nMayah Rose\nJessica Conti\nLeo Climaco\nMarta Harich\nNiurka Coteron\nJoshua Kushnereit\n© Copyright - VIP Branding Experience 2026 - \nTerms & Conditions\n | \nPrivacy Policy\nLink to: Alfonzo Alexander\nLink to: Alfonzo Alexander\nAlfonzo Alexander\nLink to: Adam Gaskill\nLink to: Adam Gaskill\nAdam Gaskill\nScroll to top\nScroll to top\nScroll to top",
    "https://vipbrandingexperience.com/portfolio-item/adam-gaskill/": "Adam Gaskill – VIP Branding Experience\nPackages\nAbout\nFounder\nClients\nContact\nMenu\nMenu\nScroll to next section\nScroll to next section\nGlobal Contribution & Marketing Strategist\nAdam Gaskill is a publisher, speaker, serial entrepreneur and philanthropist who has been in the sales and marketing industry for over two decades. Adam is a NLP Master Practitioner, has published over 45 authors, and has created over 60 non profits. Adam has dedicated his life to serving global communities through innovation, growth and contribution. He loves to travel, play basketball, explore the great outdoors and is an avid reader. He was twice awarded The Business Mastery Champion by Tony Robbins and partnered with seven time Emmy Award Winner Composer Gary Malkin. Adam has been featured in New York's Very Own PIX11 and Fox5 San Diego. Adam's greatest passion is to love and serve humanity to create a magical life for himself and others.\nCredibility Card\nShowcases the client’s trajectory, leveraging their personal experiences and passions to create a connection with their potential customers.\nProfile Picture\nAnimated Gif\nVideo Marketing Services\nVideo allows you to share the maximum amount of information quickly and has the highest engagement. If you don’t have videos on your website, social media and email marketing then you are behind your competition.\n360 Welcome\nYour 360 Site is the most powerful marketing and networking tool you have! Now, with a welcome video, your prospects and leads can get a quick tour of your 360 site and be able to fully navigate your social media and contact page. This will increase retention and 10x the \"WOW Factor\" of your 360 site.\nPersonal Intro\nIntroduction Videos are great for building relatedness between the business owners or representatives and potential\ncustomer/clients. Gives people a closer inside look which really helps separate you from the competition